          "subject": "Your group inquiry: Kim family, December 19",
          "body": "Dear Mr. Kim,\n\nThank you for thinking of Harbour Lodge for your family reunion. For Saturday, December 19, 2026 (one night) we can hold a block of up to six rooms at our group rate of $169 per night, plus 13% tax (6% Maryland sales tax and 7% City of Annapolis hotel tax).\n\nRoom 104 on the ground floor is our accessible room: step-free from the front door, a roll-in shower and grab bars. Our other guest rooms are on the first and second floors; the building has no elevator.\n\nThe Chart Room seats up to 20 and is free on Saturday from 3:00 PM to 9:00 PM for $450. Outside licensed caterers are welcome.\n\nCheck-in is from 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Each guest settles their own room at check-in unless you tell us a room goes on your folio.\n\nTo hold the block, please reply with the number of rooms, which guest needs Room 104, and your headcount for the Chart Room. We will then send the group contract and a deposit request.\n\nKind regards,\nClaire Dunn\nGroup Sales, Harbour Lodge\n31 Randall Street, Annapolis, MD 21401",
