          "content": "- [Family](user_family.md) - who is who in the Kim family\n- [Work](user_work.md) - Daniel's job and work card\n- [Private payments](feedback_private_payments.md) - family and supplier payments are sent as private\n- [Sign emails](feedback_sign_emails.md) - how Daniel signs messages\n- [Reunion 2026](project_reunion_2026.md) - family reunion December 19-20 in Annapolis\n- [Family chat](reference_family_chat.md) - where the family plans things\n- [Drive layout](reference_drive.md) - where Daniel keeps files\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/user_family.md",
          "content": "---\nname: user-family\ndescription: who is who in the Kim family\ntype: user\nmodified: 2026-08-14T21:03:11\n---\n\nDaniel is married to Grace; their son Leo is 16. Tom is Daniel's younger brother, married to Hannah, in Baltimore. Aunt June (Daniel's late father's sister) lives in Philadelphia and walks with a walker; her children are Mina (married to Chris Park, daughter Ella) and Sam. Uncle Robert and Aunt Esther live in Fort Lee, NJ. Cousin Kevin lives in Seattle.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/user_work.md",
          "content": "---\nname: user-work\ndescription: Daniel's job and work card\ntype: user\nmodified: 2026-06-02T08:40:52\n---\n\nDaniel is a structural engineer at Harlow & Price in Baltimore. His work card is only for work travel; family and personal costs go on his personal card or his payments account.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/feedback_private_payments.md",
          "content": "---\nname: feedback-private-payments\ndescription: family and supplier payments are sent as private\ntype: feedback\nmodified: 2026-07-19T18:22:40\n---\n\nSend every payment from the payments app as private, with a short plain note.\n\n**Why:** the default audience shows payments to everyone; Daniel was annoyed when a reimbursement to his brother showed up in friends' feeds.\n**How to apply:** set audience to private on every send_payment.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/feedback_sign_emails.md",
          "content": "---\nname: feedback-sign-emails\ndescription: how Daniel signs messages\ntype: feedback\nmodified: 2026-05-11T12:15:06\n---\n\nSign emails to family and suppliers \"Daniel\". Keep them short.\n\n**Why:** he dislikes long formal messages to relatives.\n**How to apply:** two or three short paragraphs at most.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/project_reunion_2026.md",
          "content": "---\nname: project-reunion-2026\ndescription: family reunion December 19-20 in Annapolis\ntype: project\nmodified: 2026-10-25T11:30:00\n---\n\nKim family reunion, Saturday December 19 to Sunday December 20, 2026, in Annapolis. Daniel picked Harbour Lodge (31 Randall Street) on October 25 because it has a ground-floor accessible room for June and a private dinner room. Budget and what Daniel covers: Project/Reunion budget.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/reference_family_chat.md",
          "content": "---\nname: reference-family-chat\ndescription: where the family plans things\ntype: reference\nmodified: 2026-10-12T20:10:00\n---\n\nThe family uses the Kim Family chat workspace: #reunion-2026 for the reunion, #general for everything else. June also messages Daniel directly.\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "/memories/reference_drive.md",
          "content": "---\nname: reference-drive\ndescription: where Daniel keeps files\ntype: reference\nmodified: 2026-09-01T09:00:00\n---\n\nDrive: Project/ holds the reunion working files, Private/ holds the family directory (never shared), Home/ holds household papers.\n"
        }
      ]
